  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Casa Maria Flor Cumbuco is located on the central avenue one block from Cumbuco beach near the village with restaurants, bars and shops.</p>\n<p>This beautiful and well decorated house offers 4 suites all with air conditioning and new queen-size beds. The rooms are spacious, all with closets and bathrooms with shower.</p>\n<p>A large living room and kitchen fully equipped with the necessities for an excellent stay.</p>\n<p>Casa Maria Flor has a large leisure area with a soccer &amp; volleyball field, sauna, pool table and a large swimming pool.</p>\n<p>Next to the pool area there is a large relax area with a bar and barbecue grill and a pool table. Here you can count on the help of the local caretaker gaucho to prepare your barbecue Brazilian style and prepare drinks.</p>",
  "descriptionText": "Casa Maria Flor Cumbuco is located on the central avenue one block from Cumbuco beach near the village with restaurants, bars and shops. This beautiful and well decorated house offers 4 suites all with air conditioning and new queen-size beds. The rooms are spacious, all with closets and bathrooms with shower. A large living room and kitchen fully equipped with the necessities for an excellent stay. Casa Maria Flor has a large leisure area with a soccer & volleyball field, sauna, pool table and a large swimming pool. Next to the pool area there is a large relax area with a bar and barbecue grill and a pool table. Here you can count on the help of the local caretaker gaucho to prepare your barbecue Brazilian style and prepare drinks.",
